OL,3,AAt least 39 die after Europe-bound
OL,4,Amigrant boat sinks off Senegal
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 39 people have died after a
OL,7,Fboat carrying migrants sank off the
OL,8,Fcoast of Senegal, the Senegalese Press
OL,9,FAgency (APS) reports.
OL,11,FThe interior ministry said one person
OL,12,Fhad been rescued, but the number of
OL,13,Fpeople still missing was yet to be
OL,14,Festablished.
OL,16,FThe small wooden boat capsized between
OL,17,Fthe capital, Dakar and the northern
OL,18,Fcity of Saint-Louis, as it headed
OL,19,Ftowards Spain's Canary Islands.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
